("normethadone","Normethadone","Synthetic opioid related to methadone.","Ticarda (historic, with an expectorant).","Developed at Hoechst in the 1940s.","Cough (historic).","US Schedule I.","a methadone-like, slower calm","within about an hour","with gentle warmth","moderate","several hours","many hours","Constipation.","Grogginess.","oral","Long-lasting opioid risk."),
